1 NAME Sara Delfina /Gallardo Drago/
2 GIVN Sara Delfina
2 SURN Gallardo Drago
2 _MARNM Gallardo Drago Mitre
1 NAME Sara Gallardo
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 23 DEC 1931
